menu "Status LED Driver Configuration"

    config DRV_LED_ENABLE
        bool "Enable status LED driver"
        default y
        help
            Compile the GPIO status LED driver into firmware.
            LED pin is defined in board.h (BOARD_LED_STATUS_GPIO).

    config DRV_LED_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "LED is active-low (LED cathode connected to GPIO)"
        default y
        depends on DRV_LED_ENABLE
        help
            Set this when the LED anode is tied to VCC through a resistor
            and the GPIO sinks current (output low = LED on), as on this board.

endmenu
